          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The Game Modes" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "The Game Modes"
          }
        },
        "nb" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Spillmodusene"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The Normal mode allows you to play as many times as you want, while the Daily Word mode provides a unique phrase each day, that is the same for all players." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "The Normal mode allows you to play as many times as you want, while the Daily Word mode provides a unique phrase each day, that is the same for all players."
          }
        },
        "nb" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Normal modus lar deg spille så mange ganger du vil, mens den Daglig Ord modusen gir en unik frase hver dag. Daglig Ord frasen er den samme for alle spillere hver dag."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The Phrase" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "The Phrase"
          }
        },
        "nb" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "The Phrase"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The Phrase is a word game where you guess a secret phrase by entering letters. The game provides feedback on your guesses, indicating correct letters and their positions." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "The Phrase is a word game where you guess a secret phrase by entering letters. The game provides feedback on your guesses, indicating correct letters and their positions."
          }
        },
        "nb" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "The Phrase er et ordspill der du får en hemmelig frase, og skal prøve å gjette den. Spillet gir tilbakemelding på gjetningene dine. Det indikerer riktige bokstaver og deres posisjoner."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The Phrase Length: " : {
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "The Phrase Length:"
          }
        },
        "nb" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Frase Lengde:"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The Phrase Was: %@!" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "The Phrase Was: %@!"
          }
        },
        "nb" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Frasen var: %@!"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Time Used: " : {
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Time Used: "
          }
        },
        "nb" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Tid Brukt: "
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "To play the game, just enter a valid phrase and submit your guess. The game will highlight correct letters in green, correct letters in the wrong position in orange, and unused letters in gray." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "To play the game, just enter a valid phrase and submit your guess. The game will highlight correct letters in green, correct letters in the wrong position in orange, and unused letters in gray."
          }
        },
        "nb" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "For å spille spillet, bare skriv inn en gyldig frase og trykk på VELG ORD knappen. Spillet vil fremheve riktige bokstaver med grønne, riktige bokstaver i feil posisjon i oransje og feil bokstaver i grått."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "To start a game, select a language and the number of letters in the phrase that you are going to guess. After that, you choose the game mode, which can be either a Normal game or a Daily Word game." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "To start a game, select a language and the number of letters in the phrase that you are going to guess. After that, you choose the game mode, which can be either a Normal game or a Daily Word game."
          }
        },
        "nb" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "For å starte et spill, velg et språk og antall bokstaver i frasen du skal gjette. Etter det velger du spillmodus, som enten kan være Normal modus eller Daglig Ord modus."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Try playing a game first or changing the selction." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Try playing a game first or changing the selction."
          }
        },
        "nb" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Prøv å spille et spill først eller endre utvalget."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Try playing a game first." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Try playing a game first."
          }
        },
        "nb" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Prøv å spille et spill først."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "View The Board" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "View The Board"
          }
        },
        "nb" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Se Brettet"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "We couldn't find a definition for this Phrase. That might be because it is a name or a placename." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "We couldn't find a definition for this Phrase. That might be because it is a name or a placename."
          }
        },
        "nb" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Vi kunne ikke finne en definisjon for denne Frasen. Det kan være fordi det er et navn eller stedsnavn. "
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Win Rate:" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Win Rate:"
          }
        },
        "nb" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Seiersrate:"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "You can also use hints to help you guess the phrase. A hint will reveal a letter in the phrase, but not the postion of the letter. You can use a hint by tapping the hint button in the top right corner, which will make you watch an ad to get the hint." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "You can also use hints to help you guess the phrase. A hint will reveal a letter in the phrase, but not the postion of the letter. You can use a hint by tapping the hint button in the top right corner, which will make you watch an ad to get the hint."
          }
        },
        "nb" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Du kan også bruke hint for å hjelpe deg med å gjette frasen. Et hint vil avsløre en bokstav i frasen, men ikke posisjonen av bokstaven. Du kan bruke et hint ved å trykke på hint-knappen øverst til høyre, noe som får deg til å se en reklame for å få hintet."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "You can change the app settings by tapping the Settings tab. This will allow you to change the default language and the default number of letters in the phrase, and the defualt game mode. You can also change the app theme, which will change the app appearance to either light or dark mode." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "You can change the app settings by tapping the Settings tab. This will allow you to change the default language and the default number of letters in the phrase, and the defualt game mode. You can also change the app theme, which will change the app appearance to either light or dark mode."
          }
        },
        "nb" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Du kan endre appinnstillingene ved å trykke på Innstillinger. Dette vil tillate deg å endre standardspråket og standard antall bokstaver i uttrykket, og standard spillmodus. Du kan også endre app temaet, som vil endre appens utseende til enten lys eller mørk modus."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "You can keep track of your game streaks by looking next to the 🔥 emoji, next to the game mode on the The Phrase tab. This will either show you how many days or games in a row you have played and managed to guess The Phrase, depending on the game mode." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "You can keep track of your game streaks by looking next to the 🔥 emoji, next to the game mode on the The Phrase tab. This will either show you how many days or games in a row you have played and managed to guess The Phrase, depending on the game mode."
          }
        },
        "nb" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Du kan følge med på spill streak-ene dine ved å se etter 🔥 emoji-en ved siden av spillmodus. Dette vil enten vise deg hvor mange dager eller spill på rad du har spilt og klart å gjette uttrykket, avhengig av spillmodus. "
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "You can share your Daily Word game results with your friends by tapping the copy button at the bottom of the screen after the game, or by going to the game history and copy it from there. This will generate a shareable text of your game results, which you can then share with your friends and family." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "You can share your Daily Word game results with your friends by tapping the copy button at the bottom of the screen after the game, or by going to the game history and copy it from there. This will generate a shareable text of your game results, which you can then share with your friends and family."
          }
        },
        "nb" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Du kan dele dine Daglig Ord resultater med vennene dine ved å trykke på kopi-knappen under bunnen av skjermen etter spillet, eller ved å gå til spillhistorikken og kopiere den derfra. Dette vil generere en delbar tekst på spillresultatene dine, som du deretter kan dele med dine venner og familie."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "You can view your game history by tapping the History tab. This will show you your game history, including the phrases you have guessed, the number of guesses you needed to win the game, the number of hints used, and the date and time of the game. You can also filter your history by language, game mode, and number of letters in the phrase." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "You can view your game history by tapping the History tab. This will show you your game history, including the phrases you have guessed, the number of guesses you needed to win the game, the number of hints used, and the date and time of the game. You can also filter your history by language, game mode, and number of letters in the phrase."
